          "anchorId": "q11",
          "modelAnswer": "(1) Timeline: 15 Oct offer (Cl. 6 arbitration) → conditional reply → <b>3:06 p.m. unconditional \"confirm deal for five shipments\"</b> → 17 Oct charter/supply → 8 Nov draft (Cl. 29) accepted with minor changes → denial → S. 11(6). (2) S. 7 ICA fulfilled (absolute/unqualified); S. 4 on opening. (3) Unsigned draft irrelevant (para 60: emails/letters/telex suffice); acting-upon corroborates. (4) Cl. 6 + Cl. 29 = <b>\"agreement in writing\" (S. 7, Arbitration Act)</b>; precedents \"not germane\". (5) Srikrishna J. appointed; Mumbai venue. Pair with S. 10A IT Act."
