          "modelAnswer": "(1) Issue: withdrawal? reasonable excuse? burden? (2) Rule: Sec 9 + Expl. (withdrawer proves excuse); reconciliation 23(2); O21 R32 attachment-only ( Saroj Rani ). (3) Cases: Kailashwati (local job + pretext → grant) vs Swaraj Garg (bona-fide distant service + transfer efforts → refuse); meld-test: pretext or genuine? (4) Apply: if W shows posting compulsion + transfer applications + H knew of service → excuse → refuse RCR ; if local job + collateral demands (separate home, no consortium) → grant . (5) Muslim variant: husband’s second marriage = reasonable excuse for first wife to live separately (Itwari line; cruelty too). (6) Conclude + ancillary: decree → 1-yr → 13(1A)(ii); maintenance unaffected/custody Sec 26."
