          "modelAnswer": "The item immediately above is the **only traceable DU semester-exam Topic 3 item in the uploaded material**. The following bank is included because it offers excellent additional practice, but it is expressly sourced as questions from CA/CS/ICWA examinations in the uploaded Taxmann text. It is **not** labelled as DU PYQ material.\n\n Part XI · Supplementary practice bank\n\n### Professional-exam questions — clearly non-DU — with answer spines\n\n Uploaded Taxmann Company Law question bank · extracted pp. 210–212Not DU PYQs\n\n The source expressly describes these as questions selected from CA (Inter/PE-II/PCC/Final), CS (Inter/Final) and ICWA (Inter) examinations. Use the prompts for timed practice after completing the DU-specific material above. Each answer spine tells you what a strong full answer must establish; links point to the detailed treatment already given in this dossier."
