          "name": "Chunilal V. Mehta & Sons Ltd. v. The Century Spinning & Manufacturing Co. Ltd.",
          "citation": "AIR 1962 SC 1314 · 1962 Supp (3) SCR 549 · Supreme Court of India · J.C. Shah & V. Mudholkar JJ. (Mudholkar J. for the Court) · Appeal by special leave against refusal of an Art. 133(1)(a) certificate by the Bombay High Court · DU Case Material (LB-302), Topic 6, Case 6 · Also the anchor case for DU PYQs Q.3/2019 & Q.4(a)/2018",
          "bench": "Supreme Court of India",
