          "name": "(DU Allied",
          "citation": "DU LB-302 pp.121–127 • Temporary injunctions beyond O.39 via S.151 • Two suits (Asansol + Indore) • Indore forum clause • PYQ Q.4(b)/2019",
          "bench": "Supreme Court of India",
