          "modelAnswer": "### ★ MODEL SKELETON (write full from §1)\n\n**Open:** Quote **R.1/R.3 twin conditions (same transaction + common Q, “and” cumulative)** + illustrations (oil/assault/bus-car) + object (multiplicity). **Table:** necessary (relief + effective-decree-impossible; partition/auction/selectees) vs proper (effective possible, complete needs; subtenant/grandsons/beneficiary) + 2 tests (*Hardeva/Kasturi*). **Effect:** Quote **R.9 + proviso** — misjoinder/proper-non-joinder **not fatal** (proceed/strike/separate trial); **necessary-non-joinder fatal** (dismiss unless added). **Cure:** **R.10 (bona fide wrong plaintiff; strike/add; consent; amend+serve; S.21)** + **S.21 proviso bona fide relate-back (*Karuppaswamy*)** + *B.P. Rao* representation + co-owner proof rule. **Objection:** Quote **R.13 earliest/before issues else waived**. Conclude with **R.8 context** (1 line)."
